<section class="section" id="overview">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="quick-answer">
            <span class="section-label">Quick Answer</span>
            <h2>Are Cozzia Massage Chairs Good?</h2>
            <p class="qa-intro">If you're researching Cozzia for the first time, here's what you need to know in plain language — before you dive into model comparisons and feature specs.</p>
            <div class="qa-grid">
                <div class="qa-item">
                    <h3>What Are Cozzia Massage Chairs?</h3>
                    <p>Cozzia is a premium massage chair brand with a multi-tier lineup spanning entry-level premium to flagship dual-mechanism designs. Their chairs are built around VarioMotion™ technology, which varies depth and speed mid-stroke to create a massage that feels less mechanical and more human. The lineup covers buyers from $3,999 to $10,999.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="qa-item">
                    <h3>Who Are They Best For?</h3>
                    <p>Cozzia chairs suit buyers who want a feature-rich premium massage chair — not a stripped-down entry model. They're especially well-suited to buyers who value 4D or dual-mechanism technology, zero gravity recline, extended track coverage, and a strong comfort-per-dollar proposition in the $4,000–$11,000 range.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="qa-item">
                    <h3>What Makes Them Stand Out?</h3>
                    <p>Three things distinguish Cozzia from most competitors: VarioMotion™ dynamic pressure variation, Li Flex Track coverage (neck to glutes on every premium model), and a genuine multi-tier lineup. The Qi XE Pro Duo's Chair Doctor™ biometric scanning is genuinely rare at this price category.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="qa-item">
                    <h3>Are They Worth Considering?</h3>
                    <p>Yes — if your budget is $4,000 or above and you want verifiable premium technology. Cozzia chairs consistently receive strong buyer satisfaction scores for everyday use, comfort on long sessions, and durability. The most important step is trying the specific model in person before purchasing.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

