            <h2 class="accent-heading">Cozzia Massage Chair FAQ</h2>
        </div>
        <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--border);">
            <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><h3>Are Cozzia massage chairs good?</h3><svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes — Cozzia massage chairs are well-regarded in the premium category for their VarioMotion™ technology, Li Flex Track spine coverage, and genuine multi-tier lineup.</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><h3>What is the best Cozzia massage chair?</h3><svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="faq-a"><p>The "best" Cozzia depends on your priorities. For maximum technology: Qi XE Pro Duo ($10,999). For best single 4D: Qi SE ($7,499). For dual-mechanism mid-premium: Zen Duo ($7,000). For strongest 4D value: Zen 2 CZ 645 ($4,299). For entry premium: Fusion Pro ($3,999).</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><h3>Are Cozzia massage chairs worth the money?</h3><svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="faq-a"><p>The value proposition is strong — particularly for the Zen 2 CZ 645 at $4,299, where you get 4D VarioMotion™ technology comparable to chairs priced $1,000–$2,000 higher at some competitors.</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><h3>What is the difference between Cozzia 4D and 3D massage chairs?</h3><svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="faq-a"><p>4D VarioMotion™ chairs add dynamic speed variation on top of adjustable depth — creating a more human-like, varied pressure pattern where the roller changes its rhythm mid-stroke. 3D chairs offer tunable depth at a more consistent speed. The Fusion Pro uses 2D with fixed-depth, consistent pressure.</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><h3>Can I try Cozzia massage chairs in person near San Jose or Pleasanton?</h3><svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. All Cozzia models are available to try in person at {{ shop.name }} showrooms in San Jose (Westfield Oakridge Mall, 925 Blossom Hill Rd) and Pleasanton (1116 Stoneridge Mall Rd). <a href="{{ shop.url }}/pages/our-store">Book an appointment here</a>.</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><h3>Where can I buy authentic Cozzia massage chairs?</h3><svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="faq-a"><p>Purchase only from authorized Cozzia dealers. {{ shop.name }} is an authorized Cozzia dealer with showrooms in San Jose and Pleasanton, CA, carrying the full current lineup with full warranty support.</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><h3>Do Cozzia massage chairs come with a warranty?</h3><svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. All Cozzia chairs include a manufacturer's warranty covering parts, labor, and structural frame — with in-home service available on eligible models.</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><h3>What is Chair Doctor™ and which Cozzia chairs have it?</h3><svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="faq-a"><p>Chair Doctor™ is Cozzia's biometric scanning system, exclusive to the Qi XE Pro Duo. It evaluates stress levels, muscle tension, and posture at the start of each session, then recommends the most appropriate massage program for how you feel <em>that day</em>.</p></div></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

